{"a":[211,211],"h":"<p>İşlerin Allaha irca' ve rucuu zarurî olunca da onun emirlerine, iradelerine karşı gelmeyib umumiyetle silme dahil olmak lâzım gelir. Hilâfına hareket edenlerin haline misal ararsan 211. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"154\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 153.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 40.6 40.6 47.3 54.7 66.0 66.0 81.7 81.7 93.0 93.0 99.7 115.6 115.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 47.3 54.7 99.7 126.0 126.0 137.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Beni İsraile sor<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"205\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 205.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 30.0 30.0 30.0 36.7 52.4 52.4 59.2 66.0 66.0 81.7 81.7 92.2 92.2 108.0 108.0 117.0 117.0 126.0 132.7 139.4 139.4 146.2 153.0 159.7 168.7 168.7 177.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 36.7 59.2 132.7 146.2 177.7 189.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> biz onlara ne kadar açık âyetler verdik, onlar bunları dinledikleri zaman ne oldular? Dinlemeyib hallerini tebdil ettikleri zaman ne oldular?<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"175\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 175.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 23.2 30.0 37.4 53.2 60.0 69.0 69.0 75.7 75.7 82.4 91.4 91.4 102.0 102.0 102.0 111.0 117.7 117.7 133.4 133.4 144.0 150.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"53.2 60.0 111.0 144.0 150.7 159.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allahın nimetini bunlar gibi her 